(audience member cheers)

43
00:01:34.563 --> 00:01:35.916
Thank you very much.

44
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:38.010
(audience laughs)
And so I'm watching that.

45
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:41.310
Were you guys watching that robo do its thing, on there?

46
00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.860
I like your technique, robo.

47
00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:43.880
You know how to make a burger.

48
00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.140
I would eat one of these.

49
00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:47.760
So imagine this, it's frozen patties in there.

50
00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.660
