52
00:01:50.493 --> 00:01:51.800
Would you try a RoboBurger?

53
00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:53.040
I would.

54
00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.790
I like burgers occasionally,

55
00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.110
