58
00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.243
Yeah. What's next?

59
00:02:00.243 --> 00:02:01.900
You think there's gonna be a RoboTaco?

60
00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.820
I mean, possibly-
Oh my God!

61
00:02:03.820 --> 00:02:05.500
Why? I mean, it's endless.
Wait a minute.

62
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.269
Why can't we have RoboBaked Potato Bar?

63
00:02:08.269 --> 00:02:09.720
(audience laughs)
Thank...

64
00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:12.270
You're a genius, Drew Barrymore.

65
00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:13.530
You remember the Jetsons?

66
00:02:13.530 --> 00:02:14.363
And we were always like,

67
00:02:14.363 --> 00:02:15.230
