68
00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.950
Well, welcome to the future, everybody.

69
00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:18.630
That's right, that's right, Rossy.

70
00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.280
All right, well now we've got a unique dining experience

71
00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:23.670
