82
00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:46.740
Wow.
They know how to do it.

83
00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.610 line:15%
Fancy.
Uh-huh.

84
00:02:47.610 --> 00:02:51.520 line:15%
