90
00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:05.730 line:15%
Chocolate lava cake, hello.

91
00:03:05.730 --> 00:03:07.750 line:15%
I mean, perfect.
(audience applauds)

92
00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.340
Perfect.

93
