96
00:03:15.860 --> 00:03:16.840
Wait, where?
In the pink shirt.

97
00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:17.960
Right here, right here, in the front corner.

98
00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:18.793
Oh my gosh.

99
00:03:18.793 --> 00:03:20.340
May I ask what your name is?

100
00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.180
Lori.

101
00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.640
Lori.

102
00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.920
How did it go when you deep fried a turkey?

103
00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.290
Well, my ex-husband did it,

104
00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.870
