105
00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:33.870
I always wanted to attempt the fried turkey

106
00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.153
and the hot oil
Oh yeah.

107
00:03:35.153 --> 00:03:37.230
But all I ever heard was how, you know,

108
00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.150
